  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"152\" data-end=\"214\">📡 <strong data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"212\">D-Link COVR AS1200 Dual Band Mesh Wi-Fi Versterker</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"273\">💥 <strong data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"273\">Betrouwbare Wi-Fi in je hele huis – slechts €49,99!</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"408\">Heb je last van zwakke Wi-Fi in bepaalde kamers? Met deze <strong data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"377\">D-Link COVR AS1200 Mesh Wi-Fi versterker</strong> los je dat snel én stabiel op!</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"413\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"445\">✅ Belangrijkste kenmerken:</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<li data-start=\"446\" data-end=\"526\">\r\n<p data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"526\">🔄 <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"493\">Dual Band Mesh Wi-Fi (2.4 GHz + 5 GHz)</strong> – snelle & stabiele verbinding</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"599\">\r\n<p data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"599\">🏠 <strong data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"552\">Naadloze dekking</strong> – ideaal voor grotere huizen of verdiepingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"663\">\r\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"663\">🔧 <strong data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"631\">Eenvoudige installatie</strong> – Plug & Play met de COVR-app</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"664\" data-end=\"736\">\r\n<p data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"736\">🔌 <strong data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"695\">Ethernetpoort aanwezig</strong> – sluit bekabelde apparaten direct aan</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"737\" data-end=\"787\">\r\n<p data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"787\">🔒 <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"762\">WPA3-beveiliging</strong> – veilig en up-to-date</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<p data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"870\">🧠 Slimme roaming – je apparaten schakelen automatisch naar het sterkste signaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"931\"